      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=122134",
      "title": "New report: Newsrooms have big multimedia ambitions; now it’s time to ace execution",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/new-report-newsrooms-have-big-multimedia-ambitions-now-its-time-to-ace-execution/",
      "published": "Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:53:50 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Most newsrooms have been committed to multimedia content production for years now. They have invested in infrastructure, tools and talent, and continue to do so. The challenge now is to turn that ambition and investment into execution. A new report from WAN-IFRA and Base Media Cloud explores what is standing in the way – and how publishers can move forward.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/new-report-newsrooms-have-big-multimedia-ambitions-now-its-time-to-ace-execution/\">New report: Newsrooms have big multimedia ambitions; now it’s time to ace execution</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
